1
00:00:00,602 --> 00:00:02,502
(Sheldon:)What would be your plan
for addressing it?

2
00:00:02,704 --> 00:00:05,034
(Amy:)I'm going to recondition your brain...

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:09,570
(Amy:)...so that the need for completion
isn't be so overwhelming.

4
00:00:11,746 --> 00:00:14,836
- By playing tic-tac-toe?
- Yep, your turn.

5
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:18,750
(Sheldon:)Oh, Amy. And you wonder why
people think neuroscience...

6
00:00:18,954 --> 00:00:21,254
(Sheldon:)...is nothing but a goofy game
for diaper babies.

7
00:00:22,624 --> 00:00:26,394
(Sheldon:)Tic-tac-toe can only end
in win, lose or draw.

8
00:00:26,595 --> 00:00:31,255
(Sheldon:)None of which will deny me closure,
especially since I'm about to win.

9
00:00:42,344 --> 00:00:44,044
(Sheldon:)But we didn't finish.

10
00:00:44,746 --> 00:00:47,276
(Amy:)Exactly. How does that make you feel?

11
00:00:49,384 --> 00:00:51,374
(Sheldon:)The same way
any normal person would.

12
00:00:51,553 --> 00:00:55,423
Feel like I wanna peel off my own face,
tear it in two and then again and again...

13
00:00:55,624 --> 00:00:59,024
(Sheldon:)...until I have a handful of
Sheldon-face confetti.

